**/.git
**/.github
**/.codex*
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/test-results
**/cypress/screenshots
**/cypress/videos
**/.lake

# Generated host copies are deliberately replaced inside the image.
lean4.js/public/lean4game
lean4.js/public/visual-lean
lean4.js/public/lean-wasm*

# Keep the downloaded Actions artifact despite the generic generated-file
# exclusions above.
!visual-lean-artifact
!visual-lean-artifact/**

# The canonical browser uses the reduced module archive. Do not even transfer
# the legacy diagnostic snapshots into the Docker build context.
visual-lean-artifact/snapshots
